2. THE BALL AND PASSIVE TEXT  —  CC BY-SA 4.0
---------------------------------------------
Applies to: the "description", "unlock", "requirement" and "recipeText" fields
in public/data/balls.json and public/data/passives.json, and the wikitext kept
in data/raw/.

That text was written by contributors to the BALL x PIT Wiki
(https://ballxpit.wiki.gg/) and is used under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Attribution: BALL x PIT Wiki contributors, https://ballxpit.wiki.gg/wiki/Balls
Share-alike: this text, and any adaptation of it, stays under CC BY-SA 4.0.
That obligation travels with the text regardless of how this site is funded.

The recipes, tiers and names themselves are facts about the game and are not
claimed by anyone here.


3. THE SPRITES  —  NOT LICENSED. © Kenny Sun.
---------------------------------------------
Applies to: everything in public/icons/ and public/icons/passives/, and the
sprites composited into public/og.png.

These are game assets, not wiki content. The wiki's own file pages state:

    "This file is owned by Kenny Sun and/or its licensors. All trademarks and
     registered trademarks present in the file are proprietary to Kenny Sun
     and/or its licensors."

They are NOT covered by the wiki's CC BY-SA licence, and no licence to them is
claimed or granted by this project. They are included because this is a free,
unofficial fan tool for players of the game.

If you are Kenny Sun, Devolver Digital, or a representative of either, and you
would like these removed or changed, contact the repository owner and it will
be done. The planner is built so the icon set can be swapped for an openly
licensed one without touching the planning logic.


TRADEMARKS
----------
"BALL x PIT" and the ball names are used descriptively, to refer to the game
they belong to. This project is unofficial and unaffiliated, is not endorsed
by Kenny Sun or Devolver Digital, and does not sell access to the game or to
any part of it.
